id: god-strike
name: God Strike
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: true
requiresTarget: true
profile: any
usageLimit: 1/round
# A God Maneuver: open where an effect grants it, only in God Ki, paid in Divine Ki Points (maneuvers.mjs whyNotGod,
# spendManeuverCost). "Upon gaining access to this God Maneuver, select a Profile" - asked at its first use and kept on
# the Maneuver (godStrikeProfile), changeable on its sheet as the Tail Attack's tail is; the only Profile it offers.
# "The DKP Cost of this Maneuver equals 1/4 (rounded up) of the KP Cost of that Profile" - and that is the whole price:
# the Basic Attack it makes pays no KP Cost of its own (the user's ruling), only a Ki Wager if one is made. "Use the
# Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver" - the attack, on a card marked out of sequence.
godManeuver: true
godStrike: true
kiCostCoversProfile: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A God Maneuver: a Basic Attack out of sequence with the Profile you selected, for 1/4 (rounded up) of its KP Cost in
  Divine Ki Points.
text: >
  God Strike [1/Round]: Infuse your attacks with extra power thanks to your godly skill.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –DKP Cost: Varies
  –Effect: Upon gaining access to this God Maneuver, select a Profile. The DKP Cost of this Maneuver equals 1/4 (rounded
  up) of the KP Cost of that Profile. When using this Maneuver, use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence
  Maneuver. Apply the selected Profile to that Attacking Maneuver.
